{"type":"message","id":"684961fb","parentId":"fe188d69","timestamp":"2026-05-17T02:29:25.752Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The site is up (TLS handshake works), but the POST endpoint returns 1101. This is a Cloudflare error (1101 = \"Worker threw exception\" or \"Could not find Worker\"). The `/send` endpoint might not exist or the worker might be failing.\n\nLet me check the API docs - maybe there's a different endpoint. Let me try `/api/send` or see what endpoints are available.\n\nActually, the user mentioned `POST /send` - maybe there's a different path structure. Let me try a few variations.\n\nBut wait, the GET /history works fine. So the issue is specifically with the POST endpoint. Error 1101 from Cloudflare Workers typically means the worker itself is failing.\n\n\nLet me test a few different POST endpoint variations to see if any of them work better.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-47dc81d1-62b2-4d3b-b508-32db52d4f49b","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"# Try different endpoint variations and check the response more carefully\ncurl -s \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" -X POST \\\n  -H \"X-API-Key: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\"threadId\":\"arbitration\",\"content\":\"test\"}' -w \"\\nHTTP_CODE:%{http_code}\" 2>&1"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-bf484efa-060d-4cb2-a4c5-1f3212c83c8d","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"# Check if there's an API docs endpoint\ncurl -s \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/api\" 2>&1\necho \"---\"\ncurl -s \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/docs\" 2>&1"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":585,"output":357,"cacheRead":22672,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":23614,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"st