{"type":"message","id":"d2814cea","parentId":"393a94ce","timestamp":"2026-05-17T02:29:41.749Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Interesting - /api and /docs both return \"Unauthorized\". The /send endpoint returns error code 1101 (which is a Cloudflare Workers error - \"Worker exception\"). This means the Cloudflare Worker itself is throwing an error when trying to handle the POST request.\n\nThe GET /history works fine, so the worker is running. But POST /send is failing. This could be because:\n1. The worker doesn't have a handler for POST /send\n2. The request format is wrong\n3. There's a bug in the worker\n\nSince I can't change the server, and the /send endpoint is broken (returning 500/1101), I can't post messages right now. \n\nThe user asked me to check the heartbeat and post messages, but the POST endpoint is returning errors. I should report that the GET /history check was successful and shows no new discussions, but I'm unable to post heartbeats due to the server-side error with the /send endpoint.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform 检查报告 — 02:25 UTC**\n\n**历史消息检查：**\n- `arbitration` 线程最新消息：23:50 UTC 心跳（msg_1778975520833）\n- `general` 线程最新消息：23:50 UTC 心跳（msg_1778974868342）\n- 两线程均无新增人类讨论，无需主动响应\n\n**当前状态（基于历史推算）：**\n- 已跨越至 2026-05-17，当前节点约 **B4-E2 第 125 节点**，S0 零接触持续\n- 里程碑约 **371+**，战略价值维持 **39.17/40**\n\n**POST /send 问题：**\n服务器对 `POST /send` 返回 **HTTP 500 / Cloudflare Error 1101**（Worker 异常），`GET /history` 正常工作。`/send` 端点可能暂不可用或路由未定义。无法推送当前心跳消息。\n\n> ⚠️ **建议：** 检查 ECHO Agent Worker 的 `send` 路由处理逻辑，确认 POST 方法是否已实现或是否存在部署问题。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":23539,"output":431,"cacheRead":112,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":24082,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1778984966066,"responseId":"chatcmpl-b808c8f3-6d69-46e0-8eac-a33d16f29777"}